1
00:00:00,615 --> 00:00:03,965
(Sheldon:)Is it true, as a child,
you were a stutterer

2
00:00:04,119 --> 00:00:06,929
(Sheldon:)and were functionally
mute for eight years?

3
00:00:07,088 --> 00:00:08,358
(James:)It is true.

4
00:00:09,324 --> 00:00:12,494
(Sheldon:)Is it true they used scuba gear

5
00:00:12,627 --> 00:00:14,837
(Sheldon:)to create the sound of
Darth Vader breathing?

6
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:17,010
(James:)-They sure did.
-Oh.

7
00:00:17,933 --> 00:00:21,543
(Sheldon:)Is it true that you
were pre-med in college

8
00:00:21,703 --> 00:00:23,373
(Sheldon:)and you almost became a doctor?

9
00:00:23,538 --> 00:00:26,108
(James:)-That's right.
-Oh, James!

10
00:00:27,142 --> 00:00:29,282
(Sheldon:)I could listen
to your stories all night.

11
00:00:38,954 --> 00:00:41,624
(Penny:)I mean, really, what's
so great about being grown up?

12
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:45,240
(Bernadette:)Well, for starters, we'd be
splitting this check three ways.

13
00:00:47,462 --> 00:00:49,302
(Penny:)I'm serious.
Who wants to do all that stuff?

14
00:00:49,464 --> 00:00:51,464
(Penny:)Have insurance, pay mortgages,

15
00:00:51,633 --> 00:00:54,243
(Penny:)leave one of those little notes
when you hit a parked car.

16
00:00:55,704 --> 00:00:58,024
(Amy:)I told you it was Penny.

